      "content": "rebuild? how? there's nothing to rebuild from. everything is gone. i look at my life and i just see a void. it's like i gave everything to a world that doesn't even want me. i'm just tired of fighting a system that's designed to crush people like me. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the pain and the struggle is to just... stop existing. it feels more logical than trying to scrape together a new life from nothing.",
